                    <num>2</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>If a declaration is in force under subclause (1), then, before the Governor-General makes regulations for the purposes of paragraph 2(a) of this Schedule, <role refersTo="#minister">the Minister</role> must take into consideration any relevant recommendation made to <role refersTo="#minister">the Minister</role> by the body specified in the declaration.</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1__sec-3A__subsec-3">
                    <num>3</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>If there is no declaration in force under subclause (1), then, before the Governor-General makes regulations for the purposes of paragraph 2(a) of this Schedule, <role refersTo="#minister">the Minister</role> must take into consideration any relevant recommendation made to <role refersTo="#minister">the Minister</role> by the Rural Industries Research and Development Corporation.</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1__sec-3A__subsec-4">
                    <num>4</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>Before the Rural Industries Research and Development Corporation makes such a recommendation to <role refersTo="#minister">the Minister</role>, the Corporation must consult with the persons who are required to pay the charge concerned.</p>
